<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8" />
	<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="true" />
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Radio+Canada:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body style="background-color: #FFFF; font-family: 'Radio Canada', sans-serif; color:#323232;">
	<table style="width: 100%;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
		<tr>
			<td align="center" valign="top">
				<table class="container" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100vh; width: 100vw;">
					<tr>
						<td align="center" valign="top">
							<img src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/Rn0qNyXiCY39Ka4uQ2msxB26rM.svg?width=790&height=150" alt="logo SouJunior" style="max-width: 505px; height: 60px;" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td align="center" valign="top">
							<h2 style="margin: 16px 0px 32px 10px; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600;">Seja bem-vindo!</h2>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td align="center" valign="top">
							<img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dja1rct0m/image/upload/v1705506384/souJunior/cnbmrjhheza1bknzt5yg.png" alt="Garota acenando" style="max-width: 360px; height: 310px;"/>
						</td>
					</tr>
                    <tr>
						<td align="center" valign="top">
							<p style="font-size: 16px; max-width: 360px; line-height: 24px; margin-bottom: 32px;">
								Para confirmar o e-mail {{email}} e concluir o seu cadastro, clique no botão abaixo:
							</p>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td align="center" valign="top">
							<a href={{url}} target="_blank" style="width: 175;
                            height: 44; opacity: 1; padding-top: 12.5px; padding-right: 24px; padding-bottom: 12.5px; padding-left: 24px; gap: 8px; border-radius: 8px; background: #003986;
                             color:#FFFF; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 32px;">Confirmar e-mail</a>
                        </td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td align="center" valign="top">
							<div class="container-small" style="max-width: 280px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap:8px; line-height: 18px; margin-top: 4px; margin-top: 32px; font-weight: 500;; ">
								<small>Caso o e-mail tenha sido enviado por engano, apenas ignore-o.</br>Por favor não responda a este e-mail.</small>
							</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
</body>
</html>